 1.4 }}>启发式评分四因子权重</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>难度接近 45% · 步骤标题序列相似度 30% · 知识点重合度 15% · 题型一致性 10%</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#E8A33D', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>当前两处缺陷</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>无最低匹配分硬性门槛；无针对每名学生已学课时的硬性过滤。主路径不要求参考题必须登记为母题。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §6</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 18 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>